RESIDENT REGISTRATION CARD

9
00:01:13,574 --> 00:01:15,325
JIN ISOO

10
00:01:28,589 --> 00:01:31,799
[Seongwon] <i>After all,
you're my Little Prince.</i>

11
00:01:31,800 --> 00:01:33,260
